              "{\"name\":\"core-layer-framework\",\"type\":\"code\",\"content\":\"# Core-Layer-Framework (Composite Pattern)\\n\\nDieses Modul im Package `common` definiert die abstrakte Schichtstruktur für verschachtelte Layer, die in der **AeonAI-UI-Pyramid-Suite** verwendet wird.\\n\\n## 1. Interface & Basis-Implementierung\\n\\n```ts\\n// packages/common/src/layers/Layer.ts\\nexport interface EmergenceMetrics {\\n  coherence: number;\\n  resonance: number;\\n  emergence: number;\\n  poetics: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Layer {\\n  id: string;\\n  level: number;\\n  weight: number;\\n  children?: Layer[];\\n  analyze(): EmergenceMetrics;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## 2. Kosmische Gewichtungen\\n\\n```ts\\n// packages/common/src/layers/weights.ts\\nexport const PHI = (1 + Math.sqrt(5)) / 2;\\nexport const PI = Math.PI;\\nexport const E = Math.E;\\n\\n/** Gewichtung basierend auf dem goldenen Schnitt */\\nexport function phiWeight(level: number): number {\\n  return Math.pow(PHI, -level);\\n}\\n\\n/** Kombinierte kosmische Gewichtung */\\nexport function combinedWeight(level: number, factor: number): number {\\n  return phiWeight(level) * Math.sin(PI * factor) + Math.log1p(E * factor);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## 3. Generierung verschachtelter Layer\\n\\n```ts\\n// packages/common/src/layers/generateNestedLayers.ts\\nimport { Layer, EmergenceMetrics } from './Layer';\\nimport { combinedWeight } from './weights';\\n\\n/**\\n * Erzeugt einen verschachtelten Layer-Baum (Tiefe = depth, Unterteilungen = subdivisions)\\n */\\nexport function generateNestedLayers(depth: number, subdivisions: number): Layer {\\n  function build(level: number): Layer[] {\\n    if (level > depth) return [];\\n    return Array.from({ length: subdivisions }, (_, idx) => {\\n      const layer: Layer = {\\n        id: `L${level}-N${idx}`,\\n        level,\\n        weight: combinedWeight(level, (idx + 1) / subdivisions),\\n        children: build(level + 1),\\n        analyze(): EmergenceMetrics {\\n          // Aggregiert alle Kinder-Metriken\\n          const childMetrics = this.children?.map(c => c.analyze()) || [];\\n          const sum = childMetrics.reduce((acc, m) => ({\\n            coherence: acc.coherence + m.coherence,\\n            resonance: acc.resonance + m.resonance,\\n            emergence: acc.emergence + m.emergence,\\n            poetics: acc.poetics + m.poetics\\n          }), { coherence: 0, resonance: 0, emergence: 0, poetics: 0 });\\n          return {\\n            coherence: this.weight + sum.coherence,\\n            resonance: this.weight + sum.resonance,\\n            emergence: this.weight + sum.emergence,\\n            poetics: this.weight + sum.poetics\\n          };\\n        }\\n      };\\n      return layer;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    id: 'root',\\n    level: 0,\\n    weight: 1,\\n    children: build(1),\\n    analyze(): EmergenceMetrics {\\n      const metrics = this.children!.map(c => c.analyze());\\n      return metrics.reduce((a,b) => ({\\n        coherence: a.coherence + b.coherence,\\n        resonance: a.resonance + b.resonance,\\n        emergence: a.emergence + b.emergence,\\n        poetics: a.poetics + b.poetics\\n      }), { coherence: 0, resonance: 0, emergence: 0, poetics: 0 });\\n    }\\n  };\\n}\\n```  \\n\\n## 4. Unit-Test\\n\\n```ts\\n// packages/common/src/layers/generateNestedLayers.test.ts\\nimport { generateNestedLayers } from './generateNestedLayers';\\n\\ndescribe('generateNestedLayers', () => {\\n  it('should create a nested layer tree and compute metrics', () => {\\n    const root = generateNestedLayers(2, 3);\\n    const metrics = root.analyze();\\n\\n    // Root should have positive emergence metrics\\n    expect(metrics.coherence).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(metrics.resonance).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(metrics.emergence).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(metrics.poetics).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n\\n    // Depth 2 and subdivisions 3 => children count = 3 at level1, each with 3 at level2\\n    expect(root.children).toHaveLength(3);\\n    root.children!.forEach(child => {\\n      expect(child.children).toHaveLength(3);\\n    });\\n  });\\n});\\n```  \\n\\n## 5. Integration in Agent\\n\\n```ts\\n// packages/agent/src/agents/CosmicTheoryAgent.ts (Auszug)\\nimport { generateNestedLayers } from 'common/layers/generateNestedLayers';\\n...\\nconst rootLayer = generateNestedLayers(config.depth, config.subdivisions);\\nconst nestedMetrics = rootLayer.analyze();\\n// nutze nestedMetrics für initiale CREP-Gewichtung oder als KI-Input\\n```\\n\\n---\\nMit diesem Composite-Pattern hast du ein flexibles Framework, um beliebige geometrische Layer-Strukturen zu modellieren, zu gewichten und analytisch auszuwerten. Es bildet das **Mathematische & Symbolische Rückgrat** deiner Pyramid-Suite! 🚀\"}"
